{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "b4cfd77986b3fa37e6f4d0d722eceb447190a92eb95ba2d6d8002b9c20289a71", "ja": "満開にカンパイ！", "zh": "为盛开干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c3c01a1f5d81ecd4ac14a505b99c685cf93a347742404034c4163c7f02d7d069", "ja": "お花見ライブが終わった後は、そのまま会場\nで簡単な打ち上げをすることに。アイドル達\nはジュース片手に今日一日の感想をそれぞれ\n語りながら、満開の夜桜の下、最後の最後ま\nでお花見を満喫するのだった。", "zh": "赏花演唱会结束后，大家决定就在会场\n简单地举办一场庆功会。偶像们一手拿着\n果汁，一边各自聊着今天一天的感想，\n在盛放的夜樱下，尽情享受赏花，直到最\n后最后一刻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d23ab6daea50ffac991d677e6ad5322ba16d9f1b260782d7c5ce9c2da7364949", "ja": "（大きな歓声と拍手の中、ライブは大成功で終わった。\nその後、会場で簡単な打ち上げをする事に……）", "zh": "（在巨大的欢呼声与掌声中，演唱会圆满落幕。之后，决定就在会场举办一场简单的庆功会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "f8cb730e2cabca986f108417aa3c334c69e627789173ca5024ae58c35e13b03a", "ja": "みんなー！　{$P$}が\nジュース買ってきたよ！　好きなの持ってってー！", "zh": "大家——！{$P$}\n买果汁回来啦！挑自己喜欢的拿吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "03dc4d14c23df478b64bd8f3a76cc1f941f4b20a9b53fe1ceb9ba98c8c41981b", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます。\n昴ちゃん、どれがいい？", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你。昴，你想要哪种？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "40284ff1f1addd5499970a8a0b20f179e0df72b72a0f8ec2669fb3bb06311805", "ja": "サンキュ！　ソーダもーらいっ。\nオレ、のどカラカラだったんだよ～！", "zh": "谢谢！汽水我就拿走啦。\n我刚才嗓子都快干了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "ab35ad937639b56dcdc59f2c9095fffada84840b6c448d4ff9863dd8ed7b9563", "ja": "MCであんなに話してたら、喉も枯れるでしょ。\nライブが無事終わったからいいようなものの……。", "zh": "在MC说了那么多话，嗓子当然会干啊。\n虽然多亏演唱会顺利结束了才没出事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "7c57b119c50d1fce0e3c862f215c3358712ab0ec0b6419dc66423633330f8bd6", "ja": "そういう静香も、お忍びでカラオケ大会に参加して、\nライブの時間ギリギリに来たよね？", "zh": "静香不也偷偷参加了卡拉OK大赛，赶在演唱会开始前才来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7599f541d3cdac529b78aaf97d50e5d52180d49cc4cca7373cd3ebb8d6d5a40e", "ja": "そうだったのか？\nやけに急いで支度してると思ったら……。", "zh": "原来是这样吗？\n难怪你当时急急忙忙地准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "ff9ca445f2c5f073b4aad4295f60619240ed8d91beebddc33ef3cc5638e55a7b", "ja": "ま、真さん！　あれは私じゃなくて……\nその……わ、私のそっくりさんです！", "zh": "真、真同学！那不是我……  \n那、那个……是、是和我长得一模一样的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "ac158974b3f888965101d5786e7ef116ac6e3048b05672d321f43e3943674f67", "ja": "ふーん、そうなんだ？　じゃあ今回は、\nそういうことにしておいてあげようかな！", "zh": "哦——原来是这样？那这次就先当作是这么回事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "a56804ead3f5365208cacdc343bfc72c7a25a75bddf69a12d8d58522dcf47fdf", "ja": "ううっ。\n次は気をつけないと……。", "zh": "呜呜。\n下次可得注意了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6d38e97552b77880084b549b10911690ebdf7fe9ae90e084d33514a53f5ed81d", "ja": "みんな、飲み物は行き渡ったな？\nそれじゃ、お花見ライブの成功を祝して……。", "zh": "大家都拿到饮料了吧？\n那么，就让我们为赏花演唱会的成功……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "d2fd8df58771c033353f251deadcbdad9c8f533696f56597bfb9783b5735b307", "ja": "カンパーイっ♪", "zh": "干杯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "d2fd8df58771c033353f251deadcbdad9c8f533696f56597bfb9783b5735b307", "ja": "カンパーイっ♪", "zh": "干杯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "d2fd8df58771c033353f251deadcbdad9c8f533696f56597bfb9783b5735b307", "ja": "カンパーイっ♪", "zh": "干杯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "d2fd8df58771c033353f251deadcbdad9c8f533696f56597bfb9783b5735b307", "ja": "カンパーイっ♪", "zh": "干杯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d2fd8df58771c033353f251deadcbdad9c8f533696f56597bfb9783b5735b307", "ja": "カンパーイっ♪", "zh": "干杯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "cae3ad3f7849caf66aeb8c4c486092b00e9b466fbdd4a9425a6bbd470d646e2b", "ja": "くーっ、生き返る～っ！\nライブが終わった後のジンジャーエールは最高だーっ！", "zh": "唔——活过来了～！\n演出结束后的姜汁汽水真是太棒啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "0cef513bf6f358ececd08af912667f8679672e14c02537c5b726c9334e4f7d48", "ja": "いい飲みっぷりだね、のり子。\nボクも付き合うから、ジャンジャン飲もうよ！", "zh": "喝得真爽快呢，法子。\n我也陪你，放开喝个痛快吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6766b2c76717a2853f0b39c07f142aaf639a493b13cf119ab5cadd7bf247fcae", "ja": "（アルコールは買ってないはずだけど……\nふたりが飲んでるの、本当にジュースだよな？）", "zh": "（我应该没买酒才对……\n她们两个喝的，真的只是果汁吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "5c8603af07d1078045903a1d70bfe52fd99d28be7e2d3662bac4ac0971157181", "ja": "今日は楽しかったです。すごく距離が近くて……\n学園祭やパーティーで、出し物を披露するみたいな。", "zh": "今天过得很开心。感觉彼此的距离特别近……就像是在学园祭或派对上表演节目一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "4b99158fe1a30b7be29cc1c7553f841a00ae843b0227334eeab3b0363205657e", "ja": "そういうコンセプトなんだろ？　なら大成功じゃん♪\nオレ、今日はぜーんぜん緊張しなかったぜ♪", "zh": "就是这种概念吧？那不就大获成功了吗♪  \n我今天完全——没紧张哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "541550f73cbd26f7371765949e0b16dd50fa0cdea5b61d77ceb7987271136526", "ja": "私は、ちょっと緊張しちゃったかな……。\n楽しかったけど、お客さんとの距離が近くて……。", "zh": "我稍微有点紧张……虽然很开心，但客人离得太近了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "810d690d885fbfc783ca7692160d21ec9c012b82cd4184e37d4e29a2b1ca20e5", "ja": "でも、最後まで盛り上げられたから……\nそう考えたら、ほんのちょっとは成長できたかも？", "zh": "不过，既然能让气氛一直热烈到最后……\n这么一想，说不定我也稍微成长了一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "82b573a9ab780d087c7952212f6bbe9d2858d5d04cebb362556c599310653666", "ja": "そうそう！　楽しいこと、よかったことを考えて\n今日はイイお花見だったなーって思わないと♪", "zh": "对对！要想着开心的事、顺利的事，觉得今天真是一次很棒的赏花才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "447e85c18853fce23614dae82a1dba352678db31ca2d6d41743320ebaa995043", "ja": "そうだな。じゃあさ、最後にもう一回ライブやる？\nオレ、全然元気だからできるぜ！", "zh": "是啊。那最后再来一次演出？我精神着呢，完全没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "63a4cf4345c7132ad8fe64545c4c875df335afa731b9f7f7dbc3b993d808c74c", "ja": "昴は元気があり余ってるみたいだな……\nもう片付けが始まってるから、ライブはまた今度な！", "zh": "昴好像精力过剩啊……\n现在已经开始收拾了，演出下次再说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "c0e5376615a4e04ca3f403b69abc727e0c430a10641f3b1b670b2b6f466ee82e", "ja": "ボクもまだ胸がドキドキしてて……体を動かしたい\n気分です。桜並木まで、ちょっと走ってこようかな。", "zh": "我也还心跳得厉害……感觉想活动活动身体。要不要跑到樱花树道那边去呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "820543e04d7085a9cd8c9e91fcc75e1c1e0108eca24bd4aa16b01d1732edd6c1", "ja": "真、オレも行く！\nどっちが先に着くか、競争しようぜ！", "zh": "真，我也去！  \n比比看谁先到吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "9eedf717aa792e9bb5a251f6953b1833c4754f01615b1ec126cbacb720afa25e", "ja": "それなら、お花見会場に行ってみないか？\nお客さんは帰ったけど、その分ゆっくりできるはずだ。", "zh": "那样的话，要不要去赏花会场看看？\n客人们已经回去了，这样应该就能悠闲些了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a3878f79ccb7003f1ee1490e73bd076a474a825f6ec0e3107eb1e7aea082552a", "ja": "わあ、いいですね。今日は充分頑張ったし、\nもう少しだけ、みんなと一緒にいたいな……♪", "zh": "哇，好呀。今天已经够努力了，\n我还想再和大家多待一会儿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "50e092f16673cc3e82273cdfadd8e4bc1311f6edad62e2123ef9a77f05092d02", "ja": "もしBGMが必要なら言ってください！\nコホン……あー、あー！　準備はできてますから！", "zh": "要是需要背景音乐就请告诉我！\n咳咳……啊——啊——！我已经准备好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "3841725969bca78bb5e742ebfe1a2a2ebe00c9086c846a29446004edd1cb2262", "ja": "じゃあ、みんなで移動しよっか！\n桜を見ながら、カンパイし直すよ～！", "zh": "那么，大家一起移动吧！\n一边赏樱，一边重新干杯吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "ae0ef1a7666c168fb45e28c5c0abca21513e7f92d80e503100a6819241f41f22", "ja": "（桜と笑顔が満開のいい花見になったな。この先も\nまたみんなと一緒に楽しい花見ができるといいな……）", "zh": "（这次真是场樱花与笑容都盛放的赏花会啊。希望以后也能继续和大家一起，享受快乐的赏花时光……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
